WEBVTT

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:26.230
Saint Seiya

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:33.820
The Underworld.

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:37.480
The land of the dead, ruled by Hades.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.060
A world without light.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:45.650
Young warriors of hope have entered
the Underworld in the name of peace.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.710
Yes, indeed.

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.620
Anything for Lord Hades

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:01.300
must pass by me.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:04.530
Now, open that chest.

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:10.600
I wanted to show Lord Hades personally.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:15.110
Suspicious bastard, what are you scheming?

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:20.570
This is the Underworld,
residence of Lord Hades.

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:25.700
There is no reason to go directly to him.

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.730
Especially a Saint like you.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:33.880
What's this?

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:39.840
Yes, the Second Prison,

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.630
where I stay,

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:45.470
is the only place where flowers
bloom in the Underworld.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:50.560
I wanted to offer these to Lord Hades.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:54.530
I see. Flowers.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.510
What?

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.740
Who are they?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.410
The Big Three of the Underworld.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:34.820
Hades! An Astonishing Identity

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.870
The Big Three of the Underworld?

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.410
Miss Pandora.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:49.690
Is there an emergency?

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:52.080
To summon all three of us here?

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.220
No, nothing.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:59.840
I just wanted to let you hear
Orphée's harp sometimes.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:01.880
Hold on, Miss Pandora.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.820
We have no time for a harp

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:06.480
when the Saints have infiltrated Underworld.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:08.740
Be quiet, Rhadamanthys.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:12.990
Lord Hades is not aware of anything yet.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:19.830
There's no point in troubling
him with this news.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:24.790
Just act like nothing has happened.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:29.050
Just quietly listen to the harp. Understand?

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:29.840
Yes.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:36.140
Damn. The Big Three had to be here today.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:38.820
Seiya.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:40.880
Shun.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.930
He's here. I didn't even notice.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:29.600
Hades is sitting on that
throne behind the curtain.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:32.290
I must do it.

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:38.520
As Athena's Saint and to
keep my promise to Eurydice.

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:42.110
This is Lyra's serene melody.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.600
Death Trip Serenade!

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:03.510
The gods stop talking.
The birds stop singing.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.490
The stars stop shining.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:11.130
They'll all fall asleep.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.610
All time in the universe stops temporarily.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:19.600
All living creatures fall asleep.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.070
Fall asleep...

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:24.000
Fall asleep...

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:38.540
Now they are asleep by
the Death Trip Serenade.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:42.560
They've practically been
transported to another dimension.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:46.240
Even if they wake up in 10 days,

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:49.180
they wouldn't know they were asleep.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:54.280
They would assume they just
listened to music the entire time.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.610
In other words, this is
our one and only chance!

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:02.210
Hades! Be prepared!

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:05.990
Why?

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:14.390
Unfortunately,

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:18.460
my ears aren't sophisticated
enough to listen to harp music.

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:21.670
Also, a man like you

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:24.290
would never turn on being a Saint.

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:27.470
I knew you would someday
show your true colors.

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:45.690
Though, Lyra Orphée, you
certainly exceed the Gold Saints

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:50.400
to be able to manipulate
two out of the three of us.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:54.500
But this is where it stops, Orphée!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.470
Greatest...

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:57.250
Rhadamanthys!

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.160
What?

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:00.580
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.240
I'm counting on you, Orphée.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:10.690
What?

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:16.090
Stop!

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:18.590
Die, Hades!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:23.530
You're Hades?

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.830
No way.

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:33.660
Impossible! That pendant...

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:34.910
That's...

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:48.080
Is that...

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.770
The same as mine?

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.980
And that face...

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:57.910
That's me!

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.870
Lord Hades.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:08.450
Why does Hades have the
same face as Andromeda?

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:11.300
No. Whatever the trick is,

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.910
we can't let this opportunity get away!

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.450
I won't let you!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.890
No, I'm your opponent!

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:21.850
Listen to my final melody!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.250
Stringer Fine!

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.560
Die, Hades!

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:38.820
All right!

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:40.600
Impossible!

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:43.550
What?

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:52.440
He disappeared. Hades disappeared!

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:57.990
Impossible. So what did I just see?

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:00.520
What just happened?

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:02.070
You bastard!

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:08.080
Orphée!

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:09.610
Hold it!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.560
If you attack now, you'll hit Orphée too.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.850
Now, return Miss Pandora, Minos

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.710
and Aiacos to their normal state.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:20.980
Never.

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:26.300
What?

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:31.350
Orphée!

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:35.200
Seiya, don't worry about
me, defeat Rhadamanthys!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:38.120
But...

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:42.200
Don't hesitate! With this
wound, I'll die anyway.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:45.320
Defeat Rhadamanthys and go after Hades!

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:48.750
Arrogant fools!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:56.980
You can't beat me.

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:59.970
Seiya, unleash your attack!

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:01.440
But...

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:02.310
Hurry!

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:05.560
If you don't wake Miss
Pandora and the others,

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:07.240
I'll just kill you now.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:09.080
Seiya.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:10.620
Orphée!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:14.110
Don't let me die in vain.

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:15.310
Attack!

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:17.220
Die!

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.530
If you truly are Athena's Saint,

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.610
hurry and attack!

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:25.700
Forgive me, Orphée!

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:28.290
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:33.140
It's unlike any of the attacks
I've received so far.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:37.050
This is truly the Eight Sense.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:39.670
Orphée!

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:45.220
Orphée, are you all right?

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.560
Please hold on!

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:54.610
You truly are Athena's Saints.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:56.140
Orphée.

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:01.390
Please. Protect Athena.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:07.580
Protect Athena.

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.120
Orphée.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.300
Orphée is...

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:23.070
He doesn't have to use the
harp to fight any longer.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.860
Eurydice.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:03.800
From now on, he can play
love songs as a star.

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.450
On a summer night,

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:12.830
if you listen closely, you
can hear Orphée's harp.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:29.000
Shun, we must stop mourning
and go after Hades.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:37.670
Rhadamanthys, are you immortal?

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:41.440
Just because you've gained strength,

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:45.760
your attack still isn't going to work on me.

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:48.840
Now you, too, shall end up like Orphée!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.850
Wait, Rhadamanthys.

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.820
I detest fighting. Withdraw at once.

00:13:57.420 --> 00:14:00.360
Not only does he look just like Lord Hades,

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:02.980
he sounds like him too.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:09.800
Shun.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.850
Just because your face looks like his,

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:19.670
and you imitate his voice, you can't fool me!

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:23.380
Did you think I would go easy on you?

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:24.960
Take this!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:27.800
Shun!

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:31.260
Did you not hear me tell you to withdraw,

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:32.860
Rhadamanthys?

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:36.340
This authority...

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:38.840
This divinity...

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:42.230
It's not something one can fake easily.

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:45.890
Could it really be him?

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:49.170
I mean, His Highness?

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:51.410
It can't be.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.410
Shun, what's going on?

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.870
Are you the Pegasus Saint?

00:14:58.590 --> 00:14:59.630
Shun.

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:08.350
There's no mistake, though his body

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:11.420
is in the form of Saint Andromeda.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.780
No, this is Shun.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.290
My friend, brother of Ikki,

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:22.360
and the one who bears the Andromeda Cloth.

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:23.720
He is Athena's Saint.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:28.260
That's right. He avoids
fighting at all costs.

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.960
He's a gentle soul.

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:33.720
Right? Isn't that right, Shun?

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:36.410
Shun.

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:42.940
Do not approach. Don't touch
me. You are my foe, Saint.

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:44.440
Shun.

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:47.330
Rhadamanthys.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.130
Yes, Lord Hades.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:52.420
Hades?

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:56.740
You called him Hades? That's ridiculous!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:00.270
Shun? No, it's impossible!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:01.990
This is crazy!

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:05.190
You must be punished for disrespecting
the Lord of the Underworld.

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:07.300
Greatest Caution!

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:21.580
Athena, I feel a tremendous
Cosmo from the Giudecca.

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:25.310
It seems it was worth the wait.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:30.260
It seems he has finally
appeared in the Underworld.

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:33.480
Lord Hades.

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:44.400
Miss Pandora.

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:48.920
I have disposed of the corpses
of Pegasus and Orphée

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:51.620
in the Cocytus as ordered.

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:53.850
Good.

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:58.240
Who knew the damn Saints would get this far?

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:01.420
We need to get rid of them all.

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:03.450
Miss Pandora.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:05.350
How is Lord Hades?

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.650
He has shed the dirty Cloth.

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:12.760
He has cleansed himself
of the filth from Earth.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:24.790
Who knew that Andromeda, a
Saint, was Lord Hades himself?

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.990
I still can't believe it.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:32.690
That boy, Andromeda, had
pledged his loyalty to Athena.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:38.390
He's still young, but he's a
Saint experienced in battle.

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:43.250
Why would a person like that
claim to be Lord Hades?

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.460
That's true.

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:50.890
Only a handful of Specters have
been in the presence of Lord Hades.

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:51.750
However...

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:58.010
Even we three have only seen
him behind that curtain.

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:03.290
So then who was behind that
curtain all this time?

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:07.230
Who was posing as Lord Hades?

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:11.350
Could it be that who we saw was...

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:12.530
All of you.

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:15.520
What are you doing, standing around there?

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:19.790
Don't worry about Lord Hades

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:22.490
and return to your respective domains.

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:29.860
Leave Lord Hades to me.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:32.080
We must not do anything unnecessary.

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:33.450
Understood?

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:34.440
Yes.

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:40.920
Focus on capturing Athena

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:45.100
and eliminate the remaining Saints.

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:46.460
Right!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:57.570
This is the Fourth Prison, the Dark Swamp.

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:02.560
You're the Specter who
guards the Fourth Prison.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:03.660
That's right.

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:07.130
I am Lycaon Phlegyas.

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:12.100
To cross the swamp we need to take the raft.

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:16.320
Is there a fare like the River Styx?

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:18.590
No fare is needed.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.650
I'll let you ride for free.

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:23.100
That is, as a corpse.

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:27.590
As expected, this isn't going
to be a smooth negotiation.

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.480
Come on, we're in a hurry.

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:33.420
Let us on!

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:36.290
Rising Dragon Punch!

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:38.810
Diamond Dust!

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:45.290
What?

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:49.040
My attack isn't working at all.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:52.990
I feel an enormous Cosmo from him.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:56.010
Die, Athena's Saints.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:57.420
Howling Inferno!

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:11.780
I have orders to send your corpses

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:14.260
to the darkest hell to set an example.

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:18.250
Now, I'll have you get
aboard with these corpses.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.450
What are you doing, pushing the raft away?

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:30.830
Are you scared after I
took down the other two?

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:37.250
Unfortunately, I'll get you on
the raft one way or another.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:41.690
Right, I'll get on. After I defeat you.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:46.550
Nonsense! You'll get on the raft as a corpse.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:49.600
Take this! Howling Inferno!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:52.160
It's unfortunate.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:54.610
The same attack doesn't
work on a Saint twice.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:56.770
What?

00:20:58.610 --> 00:20:59.840
Take this!

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:02.950
Galaxian Explosion!

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:21.440
I was going to ask you how far
it was to the Fifth Prison.

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:26.950
It's fine. It seems like
you can't move your mouth.

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:37.230
Forgive me, Lord Hades.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:43.230
I unintentionally did a horrible thing.

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:51.940
I didn't think you would be
hiding in Orphée's chest.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:56.160
I unknowingly thrust my spear into it.

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:59.600
I am relieved you were only scratched.

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:04.560
I can't imagine what I would
do if I had killed you.

00:22:04.810 --> 00:22:08.630
Are these wounds from protecting Pegasus?

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:11.700
You are too kind.

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:19.840
My heart is at ease, Lord Hades.

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:26.560
My beloved brother.

00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:05.400
The Fifth Prison is filled with flames.

00:24:05.740 --> 00:24:08.730
When the road to Giudecca started to open,

00:24:08.730 --> 00:24:12.150
the Big Three appear and hope is lost.

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:14.350
Are we going to be defeated

00:24:14.610 --> 00:24:16.840
by their immense power?

00:24:16.950 --> 00:24:21.410
No... This flaming Cosmo
means the arrival of that man!

00:24:21.690 --> 00:24:24.990
Saint Seiya:
"A Ferocious Battle! The Road to Giudecca."

00:24:25.360 --> 00:24:27.900
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
